                    requirementType="#3ec90f98-f273-4a93-9fb6-a698ffaa25c4" ReqIFText="&lt;p>When requested by the monitoring channel of the Flight Control System, the propulsion unit shall desactivate itself&amp;nbsp;and not produce any thrust.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
