              <ownedFunctions xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.pa:PhysicalFunction"
                  id="9fab25fe-945c-4148-b179-71e0ae32f48f" sid="9fab25fe-945c-4148-b179-71e0ae32f48f"
                  name="[SF7.2.4] Control pitch angle MON" description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The monitoring processor shall compute Ptheta as the result of the closed loop control of the pitch angle to reach the Pitch consign MON&amp;nbsp;from the current Drone pitch and Drone pitch rate measurement.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The monitoring processor shall compute the Ptheta validity status as follow : IF (Drone pitchis INVALID) OR (Drone pitch rate validity status&amp;nbsp;is INVALID) OR (Pitch consign validity status&amp;nbsp;is INVALID)&amp;nbsp;THEN Ptheta validity status is INVALID ELSE Ptheta validity status is VALID&lt;/p>&#xA;"
                  appliedPropertyValueGroups="#d96f2c17-81dd-40fb-9260-b207e13e46e7">
                <ownedPropertyValueGroups xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.capellacore:PropertyValueGroup"
