                  name="[SF7.3.5] Disable drone motor" description="&lt;p>REQ&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The monitoring processor shall disable all engine when an attitude measure failure or an altitude measure failure or a Motor consign failure is detected.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>For each motor, the monitoring processor shall disable the motor when a Motor runaway is detected.&lt;/p>&#xA;"
