                  name="[SF1.1.6] Depower motor 1" description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The&amp;nbsp;MCPS shall shut down the Motor&amp;nbsp;1 command when Motor 1 disabled is &amp;quot;Requested&amp;quot; or when its status is INVALID.&lt;/p>&#xA;"
