                  name="[SF1.3.6] Depower motor 3" description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The MCPS&amp;nbsp;shall shut down the Motor&amp;nbsp;3 command when Motor&amp;nbsp;3 disabled is &amp;quot;Requested&amp;quot; or when its status is INVALID.&lt;/p>&#xA;"
