                  name="[SF1.4.6] Depower motor 4" description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The MCPS shall shut down the Motor 4&amp;nbsp;command when Motor&amp;nbsp;4 disabled is &amp;quot;Requested&amp;quot; or when its status is INVALID.&lt;/p>&#xA;"
