                  name="[SF4.3.1] Select drone control mode" description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The main processor shall select the AP mode as follows&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;colgroup width=&quot;204&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/colgroup>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;colgroup span=&quot;3&quot; width=&quot;207&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/colgroup>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;colgroup span=&quot;4&quot; width=&quot;245&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/colgroup>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;tbody>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Pilot control mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Manual override&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; colspan=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Mission completed&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Selected AP mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Selected control mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Value&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Validity status&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Value&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td al